#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:1
msgid "用 HistoryPanel 研究横截面选股因子"
msgstr "Using HistoryPanel to study cross-sectional stock-picking factors"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:3
msgid ""
"**前置**：[教程 2.0 最小数据集](2.0-get-data.md) + [教程 2.5](2.5-historypanel-data-"
"analysis.md)（建议先完成 2.5 §0）。"
msgstr ""
"**Prerequisites**: [Tutorial 2.0 Minimum Data Set](2.0-get-data.md) + "
"[Tutorial 2.5](2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md) (it is recommended to "
"complete 2.5 §0 first)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:5
msgid ""
"**关于本篇**：在**多只股票**上，按**同一交易日**的截面条件筛选标的，再聚合成动态篮子并与基准对比——这是 `HistoryPanel` "
"典型的**横截面选股研究**场景。"
msgstr ""
"**About this article**: On **multiple stocks**, the targets are screened "
"according to the cross-sectional conditions of **the same trading day**, and"
" then aggregated into a dynamic basket and compared with the benchmark - "
"this is a typical **cross-sectional stock selection research** scenario of "
"`HistoryPanel`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:7
msgid ""
"**研究链路**：多因子（横向）→ 截面 bool 条件 → ``where`` 掩码 → ``portfolio`` + benchmark → "
"``normalize`` / ``cum_return`` + CAGR → ``plot(highlight)`` 解释。"
msgstr ""
"This tutorial follows a “get it working first, then enhance it” rhythm to "
"build this pipeline into a reusable research workflow:   **multi-factor "
"(cross-sectional) -> cross-sectional conditions -> `where` mask -> "
"`portfolio + benchmark` -> `normalize/cum_return + CAGR` -> `plot/highlight`"
" explanation.**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:9
msgid ""
"**注**：``portfolio`` / ``cum_return`` 均为**研究向**粗聚合，**不含**完整回测语义；迁移至 "
"``Operator`` 见 [2.5 §9](2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md#9-从-historypanel-"
"研究到-strategy--operator迁移路径)。"
msgstr ""
"**Note**: ``portfolio`` / ``cum_return`` 均为**研究向**粗聚合，**不含**完整回测语义；迁移至 "
"``Operator`` See [2.5 §9](2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md#9-From-"
"historypanel-research to-strategy--operator migration path)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:11
msgid ""
"做横截面选股时，我们常遇到一种「很真实但很别扭」的情况：手里有一堆股票、也知道要用多个指标筛选（PE、PB、动量、波动率……），但写成代码后容易出现形状对不上、条件广播错了、筛出来的股票不稳定——最后只剩一条组合曲线，却说不清到底是哪几个条件在驱动收益差异。"
msgstr ""
"When doing cross-sectional stock selection, we often encounter a \"very real"
" but awkward\" situation: we have a bunch of stocks in our hands, and we "
"know that we need to use multiple indicators to screen (PE, PB, momentum, "
"volatility...), but after writing the code, it is easy to find that the "
"shape does not match, the conditions are broadcast wrong, and the screened "
"stocks are unstable. In the end, there is only one combination curve left, "
"but it is unclear which conditions are driving the difference in returns."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:13
msgid "本篇按「先跑通，再增强」的节奏，把上述链路搭成可复用的研究流程。"
msgstr ""
"This article follows the rhythm of \"run through first, then enhance\" to "
"build the above links into a reusable research process."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:17
msgid "数据检查——跑通横截面筛选最小闭环"
msgstr ""
"Data inspection - running through the cross section to filter the smallest "
"closed loop"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:19
msgid ""
"我们先不追求因子多、也不追求参数精细；最小可跑只要做到两件事：多只股票能跑通横向筛选，且能画出组合曲线并与 ``000300.SH`` 对比。"
msgstr ""
"We are not pursuing too many factors, nor are we pursuing precise "
"parameters; the minimum runnability only requires two things: multiple "
"stocks can pass the horizontal screening, and the combination curve can be "
"drawn and compared with ``000300.SH``."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:43
msgid "当上面代码能正常出图时，说明多标的 K 线数据已就绪；下文将把「多因子条件 → 每日篮子 → CAGR 对比」跑通。"
msgstr ""
"When the above code can output the chart normally, it means that the multi-"
"standard K-line data is ready; the following will run through the \"multi-"
"factor conditions → daily basket → CAGR comparison\"."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:45
msgid "不过，仅仅「能画出来」还远远不够。 如果我们真的要把它当成日常选股研究工具来用，至少会遇到下面这些问题："
msgstr ""
"However, just \"being able to draw\" is not enough. If we really want to use"
" it as a daily stock selection research tool, we will at least encounter the"
" following problems:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:48
msgid ""
"**多因子条件怎么对齐**：PE/PB/动量/波动这些概念很好理解，但一写代码就会踩坑：有的因子是 `(M,L)`，有的被您写成 "
"`(M,L,1)`，再加上 `HistoryPanel` "
"自带的第三维字段列，最终很容易在广播时“对上了但不是您以为的那个对”。最麻烦的是，这类错往往不报错，只会让结果看起来“怪”。"
msgstr ""
"**How ​​to align multi-factor conditions**: The concepts of "
"PE/PB/momentum/fluctuation are easy to understand, but once you write the "
"code, you will run into pitfalls: some factors are `(M,L)`, and some are "
"written as `(M,L,1)`, plus the third-dimensional field column that comes "
"with `HistoryPanel`. In the end, it is easy to \"match but not the pair you "
"thought\" during the broadcast. The most troublesome thing is that this kind"
" of error is often not reported, and it only makes the result look "
"\"weird\"."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:49
msgid ""
"**选股是截面决策**：横向选股不是“对每只股票单独下判断”，而是“同一天从一堆股票里挑一批”。这意味着您的持仓集合每天都可能变：今天 10 只，明天 "
"3 只，后天可能 0 只。如果您不把“每天入选篮子”显式固化下来（例如用 mask），您根本没法复盘“那天到底选了谁”。"
msgstr ""
"**Stock selection is a cross-sectional decision**: Horizontal stock "
"selection is not \"making an independent judgment on each stock\", but "
"\"selecting a batch of stocks from a pile of stocks on the same day.\" This "
"means that your position set may change every day: 10 stocks today, 3 stocks"
" tomorrow, and 0 stocks the day after tomorrow. If you don't explicitly "
"solidify the \"daily selection basket\" (for example, using a mask), you "
"can't review \"who was selected that day\" at all."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:50
msgid ""
"**没有 benchmark 对比就没结论**：组合曲线看起来不错并不等于有效，它可能只是踩中了市场 beta。把 `000300.SH` "
"拉进来做对照，至少能回答一个最关键的问题：这套筛选是在创造超额，还是只是跟随大盘？"
msgstr ""
"**Without a benchmark comparison, there’s no conclusion**: a combined curve "
"looking good doesn’t mean it’s effective—it may just be riding market beta. "
"Bring `000300.SH` in as a reference; at minimum it answers the most critical"
" question: is this screen creating alpha, or just following the broad "
"market?"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:51
msgid ""
"**有收益没解释**：横向筛选很容易“只剩一条曲线”。但真正的研究需要解释：收益差异最大的那几天，是不是恰好发生了风格切换？是不是筛选条件把我们带到了高波动/高回撤的角落？能不能快速定位到“关键分化段”，再决定下一步该加强哪条因子？"
msgstr ""
"**Returns without an explanation**: cross-sectional screening can easily end"
" up with “only one curve left.” But real research needs an explanation: on "
"the days with the largest return differences, did a style rotation happen to"
" occur? Did the screening criteria push us into a corner with high "
"volatility/high drawdown? Can we quickly pinpoint the “key divergence "
"segment,” and then decide which factor to strengthen next?"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:53
msgid "好在这些能力都可以一步步补齐。接下来我们就从“因子构造”开始。"
msgstr ""
"Fortunately, these capabilities can all be filled in step by step. Next, "
"we’ll start with “factor construction”."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:57
msgid "先贴最终效果（我们最后会得到什么）"
msgstr "Post the final effect first (what will we get in the end)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:59
msgid "按本文做完，您会得到三个非常“研究友好”的产出："
msgstr ""
"After following this article, you will get three very \"research-friendly\" "
"outputs:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:61
msgid ""
"**一张组合曲线对比图**：`LONG / SHORT / 000300.SH`（或至少 `LONG / 000300.SH`）统一从 1.0 "
"起点归一化，肉眼就能看出筛选规则在样本期内是否有区分度。"
msgstr ""
"**A portfolio curve comparison chart**: `LONG / SHORT / 000300.SH` (or at "
"least `LONG / 000300.SH`) normalized to start from 1.0, so you can tell at a"
" glance whether the screening rule has discriminative power within the "
"sample period."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:62
msgid "**一张 CAGR 摘要表**：把累计收益折算成年化口径，方便不同区间横向比较。"
msgstr ""
"**A CAGR summary table**: convert cumulative returns into an annualized "
"metric, making it easy to compare across different periods."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:63
msgid "**一张“关键差异日/分化段”高亮图**：把 long 组合与 benchmark 分化最明显的点标出来，便于复盘与解释。"
msgstr ""
"**A single “key divergence day/divergence segment” highlight chart**: mark "
"the points where the long portfolio diverges most clearly from the "
"benchmark, making it easier to review and explain."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:67
msgid "目标（我们这篇文章要完成什么）"
msgstr "Goal (what we want to accomplish with this article)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:69
msgid "获取多 shares + `000300.SH` 的 `HistoryPanel`"
msgstr "Fetch the `HistoryPanel` for multiple shares + `000300.SH`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:70
msgid "构造多因子（两条路线并列：代理因子固定阈值版 + 可选真实估值版）"
msgstr ""
"Construct multi-factors (two routes in parallel: a proxy-factor fixed-"
"threshold version + an optional true-valuation version)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:71
msgid "把多因子条件组合成 `(M,L)` bool，并用 `where()` 生成研究 mask"
msgstr ""
"Combine multi-factor conditions into a `(M,L)` bool, and use `where()` to "
"generate the research mask"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:72
msgid "用 `portfolio(mask=...)` 得到 long/short 两组组合曲线，并与 benchmark 对比"
msgstr ""
"Use `portfolio(mask=...)` to get the long/short portfolio curves, and "
"compare them with the benchmark"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:73
msgid "用 `normalize/cum_return` 推导 CAGR 表"
msgstr "Use `normalize/cum_return` to derive the CAGR table"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:74
msgid "用 `plot(highlight=...)` 高亮“差异最大日/关键分化段”，做到可解释"
msgstr ""
"Use `plot(highlight=...)` to highlight the “max-difference day/key "
"divergence segment” and make it explainable"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:75
msgid "文末给出一段「单函数可跑」的完整代码"
msgstr ""
"At the end of the article, a complete code of \"a single function can be "
"run\" is given."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:76
msgid "明确研究口径边界：``portfolio`` 不是交易回测"
msgstr ""
"Clear research caliber boundary: ``portfolio`` is not a trading backtest"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:80
msgid "复现前置"
msgstr "Recurrence prefix"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:82
msgid ""
"**前置条件**：同 [2.0 最小数据集](2.0-get-data.md#最小数据集清单供-25-使用)；示例股票池约 10 只 + "
"``000300.SH``，正式研究可扩展到 30~80 只（过多不利于读图）。"
msgstr ""
"**Prerequisites**: Same as [2.0 Minimum Data Set](2.0-get-data.md#Minimum "
"Data Set List for -25- use); the sample stock pool is about 10 stocks + "
"``000300.SH``, and the formal research can be expanded to 30~80 stocks (too "
"many stocks are not conducive to reading the picture)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:84
msgid "**提示**：数据未就绪请先完成 [教程 2.0](2.0-get-data.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Tip**: If the data is not ready, please complete [Tutorial 2.0](2.0-get-"
"data.md) first."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:88
msgid "准备数据：多 shares + benchmark（控制数量，让图可读）"
msgstr ""
"Prepare data: multiple shares + benchmark (control the number and make the "
"graph readable)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:90
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:142
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:268
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:294
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:339
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:400
msgid "本节要解决什么"
msgstr "What is going to be solved in this section?"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:92
msgid "横向截面研究最常见的陷阱之一是：   **股票太多，一次性画图读不动；股票太少，又体现不出“横向筛选”的意义。**"
msgstr ""
"One of the most common traps in cross-sectional research is:   **too many "
"stocks, and you can’t digest the plots in one go; too few stocks, and you "
"can’t reflect the meaning of “cross-sectional screening.”**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:95
msgid ""
"所以我们建议先把样例控制在 30~80 只以内（实际您可以替换成自己的股票池）。   本节只做一件事：把数据拿到手并确认 `close` 存在。"
msgstr ""
"Therefore, we recommend that you first control the sample size within 30~80 "
"stocks (actually, you can replace it with your own stock pool).   This "
"section only does one thing: get the data and confirm that `close` exists."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:98
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:154
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:272
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:298
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:347
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:407
msgid "最小必要原理"
msgstr "principle of least necessary"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:100
msgid ""
"后面所有组合聚合默认都围绕 `close` 做，因此只要 `close` 在 `hp.htypes` 中，我们就能跑通完整闭环。   OHLC "
"是否齐全决定我们能不能画 K 线、能不能做事件型解释；本篇以横向筛选为主，OHLC 可作为可选项。"
msgstr ""
"All subsequent portfolio aggregation defaults to being centered around "
"`close`, so as long as `close` is in `hp.htypes`, we can run the full closed"
" loop end-to-end.   Whether OHLC is complete determines whether we can plot "
"candlesticks and whether we can do event-style explanations; this article "
"focuses mainly on cross-sectional screening, and OHLC can be optional."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:103
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:180
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:280
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:308
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:412
msgid "可运行代码 + 预期效果"
msgstr "Runnable code + expected results"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:140
msgid "多因子构造（两条路线并列）：固定阈值代理版 + 可选真实估值版"
msgstr ""
"Multi-factor construction (two routes side by side): fixed threshold proxy "
"version + optional real valuation version"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:144
msgid ""
"这一步我们要得到的是：**能够直接组合成筛选条件的因子矩阵**。   在“横向截面”里，我们希望每一个因子最终都能落到同一个形状：`(M, L)`。"
msgstr ""
"In this step, what we want is: **a factor matrix that can be directly "
"combined into screening conditions**.   In a “cross section,” we want each "
"factor to ultimately land in the same shape: `(M, L)`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:147
msgid "为简单起见，这里我们分成两条路线："
msgstr "For simplicity, here we split into two tracks:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:149
msgid "**路线 A（入门推荐）**：完全用行情/技术指标派生“代理因子”，配合**固定阈值**，保证所有人都能跑通"
msgstr ""
"**Route A (recommended for beginners)**: derive “proxy factors” entirely "
"from market data/technical indicators, paired with **fixed thresholds**, to "
"ensure everyone can run it through"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:150
msgid "**路线 B（可选增强）**：如果您的本地数据源里已经有 PE/PB/EBITDA 等估值字段，就把它们替换进来"
msgstr ""
"**Route B (optional enhancement)**: If your local data source already has "
"valuation fields such as PE/PB/EBITDA, replace them with them"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:152
msgid "两条路线最终都输出同样的 `cond_long/cond_short`，后面的流程完全一致。"
msgstr ""
"Both routes ultimately output the same `cond_long/cond_short`, and the "
"subsequent workflow is exactly the same."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:156
msgid "`HistoryPanel.kline.*` 会返回带新增列的新面板，例如："
msgstr ""
"`HistoryPanel.kline.*` will return a new panel with additional columns, for "
"example:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:158
msgid "`sma_20`"
msgstr "`sma_20`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:159
msgid "`macd_hist_12_26_9`"
msgstr "`macd_hist_12_26_9`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:160
msgid "`bbands_upper_20_2_2` 等"
msgstr "`bbands_upper_20_2_2` etc."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:162
msgid ""
"这些列都能通过 `hp.htypes.index(name)` 定位成 `(M, L)` 的二维矩阵。   "
"然后我们就可以写出固定阈值的多因子条件，并确保最终条件是 `(M, L)` 的 bool。"
msgstr ""
"All of these columns can be located via `hp.htypes.index(name)` into a 2D "
"matrix of `(M, L)`.   Then we can write multi-factor conditions with fixed "
"thresholds, and make sure the final condition is a `(M, L)` bool."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:165
msgid "路线 A：代理因子（固定阈值，推荐先跑通）"
msgstr ""
"Route A: Agency factor (fixed threshold, recommended to run through first)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:167
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:233
msgid "要解决什么"
msgstr "What to solve"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:169
msgid "我们用三个“非常直觉”的代理因子，让读者快速进入状态："
msgstr ""
"We use three “very intuitive” proxy factors to help readers get into the "
"flow quickly:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:171
msgid "**价值代理**：`close / sma20`（偏离均线越低越“便宜”）"
msgstr ""
"**Value proxy**: `close / sma20` (the lower the deviation from the moving "
"average, the more “cheap” it is)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:172
msgid "**动量代理**：`macd_hist`（强弱）"
msgstr "**Momentum proxy**: `macd_hist` (strength/weakness)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:173
msgid "**风险代理**：布林带带宽（波动大小）"
msgstr "**Risk proxy**: Bollinger Band width (volatility magnitude)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:175
msgid "这里要强调两点“研究口径上的诚实”："
msgstr ""
"Two points of “honesty in research conventions” are worth emphasizing here:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:177
msgid "这些都是**代理**，不是财务意义上的“真估值”。它们的价值在于：**人人都能从行情数据派生出来**，并且在某些风格下确实能形成分层效果。"
msgstr ""
"These are all **proxies**, not “true valuation” in the financial sense. "
"Their value lies in: **everyone can derive them from market data**, and "
"under certain styles they can indeed produce a stratification effect."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:178
msgid ""
"它们也有明显局限：`close/sma20` 可能把趋势当成便宜/贵；MACD "
"可能在震荡区来回打脸；带宽过滤会把“波动带来的机会”也一起过滤掉。本文的重点是把链路跑通，阈值本身只是一个可复现的起点。"
msgstr ""
"They also have clear limitations: `close/sma20` may mistake a trend for "
"cheap/expensive; MACD may keep getting slapped in a choppy range; a "
"bandwidth filter will also filter out “opportunities created by volatility.”"
" The focus of this article is to get the pipeline running end to end; the "
"thresholds themselves are just a reproducible starting point."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:216
msgid "到这里我们就拿到了横向筛选的“核心原料”：`cond_long/cond_short (M,L bool)`。"
msgstr ""
"At this point we’ve obtained the “core ingredients” for cross-sectional "
"filtering: `cond_long/cond_short (M,L bool)`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:218
msgid ""
"下一步，我们还需要做一个非常实用的 sanity check：**每天到底选中了多少只股票**。   如果这个数量经常是 "
"0（空篮子），您的组合曲线会断断续续，结论也很不稳定；如果这个数量几乎总是全部股票，那筛选就没有意义了。"
msgstr ""
"Next, we need to do a very practical sanity check: **how many stocks are "
"selected every day**.   If this number is often 0 (empty basket), your "
"portfolio curve will be choppy and your conclusions unstable; if this number"
" is almost always all stocks, there is no point in screening."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:221
msgid "您可以加上这段检查（不改逻辑，只帮我们判断阈值是否“太严/太松”）："
msgstr ""
"You can add this check (without changing the logic, it just helps us "
"determine whether the threshold is \"too strict/too loose\"):"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:231
msgid "路线 B：真实估值因子（可选增强，字段名以 `hp.htypes` 为准）"
msgstr ""
"Route B: True valuation factor (optional enhancement, field name shall be "
"based on `hp.htypes`)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:235
msgid ""
"如果您的本地数据源里已经下载过估值字段（例如 PE/PB/EBITDA），那我们就可以把它们替换进来。   "
"这一节我们不写死字段名，因为不同数据源/数据类型的 htype 命名可能不一样。最稳妥的方式是："
msgstr ""
"If you have downloaded valuation fields (such as PE/PB/EBITDA) from your "
"local data source, we can replace them.   We do not hard-code field names in"
" this section, because the htype names of different data sources/data types "
"may be different. The safest way is:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:238
msgid "先打印 `hp.htypes`"
msgstr "First print `hp.htypes`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:239
msgid "找到您本地实际列名"
msgstr "Find your local actual column name"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:240
msgid "再按固定阈值写条件"
msgstr "Then write the conditions using fixed thresholds"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:242
#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:352
msgid "可运行代码（示意）"
msgstr "Runnable code (illustration)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:260
msgid "只要最终您仍然得到 `(M, L)` 的 `cond_long/cond_short`，后面流程就与路线 A 完全一致。"
msgstr ""
"As long as you still end up with `cond_long/cond_short` of `(M, L)`, the "
"following process is exactly the same as route A."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:262
msgid ""
"如果您发现自己本地根本没有这些字段，也没关系：这正是我们把“代理因子版”放在正文主线的原因。路线 B 作为增强分支存在，但不依赖它也能完整跑通研究闭环。"
msgstr ""
"If you find that you don't have these fields locally, that's okay: that's "
"why we put \"Agent Factor Version\" in the main line of the text. Route B "
"exists as an enhanced branch, but you can complete the research closed loop "
"without relying on it."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:266
msgid "横向筛选：条件组合 -> `where()` 研究 mask"
msgstr ""
"Horizontal filtering: condition combination -> `where()` Research mask"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:270
msgid "我们把 `cond_long/cond_short` 变成可直接喂给 `portfolio(mask=...)` 的研究 mask。"
msgstr ""
"We turn `cond_long/cond_short` into a research mask that can be fed directly"
" into `portfolio(mask=...)`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:274
msgid ""
"`hp.where()` 支持把 `(M, L)` 的 bool 条件规整成 `(M, L, N)` 的 mask。   "
"这一步把“截面筛选规则”固化为“研究口径”，后面所有聚合与收益计算都以此为准。"
msgstr ""
"`hp.where()` supports reshaping `(M, L)` boolean conditions into an `(M, L, "
"N)` mask.   This step solidifies the “cross-sectional screening rules” into "
"a “research definition,” and all subsequent aggregation and return "
"calculations follow this as the standard."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:277
msgid ""
"这也是横向研究里最值得养成的一个习惯：**永远不要只保留一条“组合曲线”，要把“每天入选篮子”的规则也显式保留下来**。   mask "
"就是这条规则。它让您能回答“那天到底选了谁”这种复盘问题。"
msgstr ""
"This is also the most worth developing habit in horizontal research: **Never"
" keep just one \"combination curve\", but also explicitly keep the rule of "
"\"selecting into the basket every day\"**.   mask is this rule. It allows "
"you to answer the review question of \"who did you pick that day?\""

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:292
msgid "两组组合曲线 + benchmark：`portfolio(mask=...)`"
msgstr "Two sets of combination curves + benchmark: `portfolio(mask=...)`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:296
msgid "对每个交易日，把满足条件的股票集合聚合成一条组合曲线（long/short），并与 `000300.SH` 对比。"
msgstr ""
"For each trading day, aggregate the set of stocks that meet the conditions "
"into a portfolio curve (long/short), and compare it with `000300.SH`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:300
msgid "`portfolio` 是研究粗聚合，不是交易执行"
msgstr "`portfolio` is for coarse research aggregation, not trade execution"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:301
msgid "`benchmark_output='tag_along'` 会把基准行追加进输出，便于同图对比"
msgstr ""
"`benchmark_output='tag_along'` will append the benchmark row to the output, "
"making it easy to compare on the same chart"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:303
msgid "您可以把它理解成：对每一天，把“当日入选的股票集合”做等权平均，得到一条曲线。   由于集合每天会变，所以这条曲线本质上是在回答一个问题："
msgstr ""
"You can understand it as: for each day, do an equal-weighted average of the "
"\"set of stocks selected on that day\" to get a curve.   Since the set "
"changes every day, this curve essentially answers the question:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:306
msgid "如果我每天都只持有“符合条件的那一批”，这个动态篮子长期表现如何？"
msgstr ""
"If every day I only hold “the batch that meets the criteria,” how does this "
"dynamic basket perform over the long run?"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:337
msgid "`normalize / cum_return` + CAGR：给出可比较的年化摘要表"
msgstr ""
"`normalize / cum_return` + CAGR: gives a comparable annualized summary table"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:341
msgid "我们既想“看曲线”，也想“有一个能复用的数字总结”。   所以我们做两件事："
msgstr ""
"We want to both “look at the curve” and “have a reusable numeric summary.”"
"   So we do two things:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:344
msgid "`normalize`：统一起点，便于目视"
msgstr "`normalize`: align the starting point (for easier visual comparison)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:345
msgid "`cum_return + CAGR`：输出表格摘要"
msgstr "`cum_return + CAGR`: output a summary table"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:349
msgid ""
"`cum_return` 输出累计收益 `cumret_*`；用末值配合年数可以推导 CAGR。   （具体 CAGR "
"定义见前文讨论；这里不再展开推导。）"
msgstr ""
"`cum_return` outputs cumulative return `cumret_*`; using the ending value "
"together with the number of years lets you derive CAGR.   (For the exact "
"definition of CAGR, see the earlier discussion; we won’t expand the "
"derivation here.)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:375
msgid "建议您把它整理成一个小表（至少包含 LONG/SHORT/benchmark 三行），这样读者一眼就能比较："
msgstr ""
"It is recommended that you organize it into a small table (containing at "
"least three lines of LONG/SHORT/benchmark) so that readers can compare at a "
"glance:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:398
msgid "可视化与解释：用 `plot(highlight=...)` 高亮“关键差异日”"
msgstr ""
"Visualization and Interpretation: Highlight “Key Difference Days” with "
"`plot(highlight=...)`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:402
msgid "横向截面研究做到最后，最需要解释的一类问题是：   **long 和 benchmark 差异最大的一段，到底发生了什么？**"
msgstr ""
"When you take cross-sectional research all the way to the end, the type of "
"question that most needs explaining is:   **in the stretch where long and "
"the benchmark diverge the most, what exactly happened?**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:405
msgid "因此我们用 `highlight` 高亮一段“关键差异日”（例如累计收益最大点/最小点，或您自己挑的区间），把读者的注意力拉回图上。"
msgstr ""
"Therefore, we use `highlight` to highlight a period of \"key difference "
"days\" (such as the maximum point/minimum point of cumulative income, or a "
"range of your own choosing) to draw the reader's attention back to the "
"chart."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:409
msgid ""
"highlight 支持 `'max'/'min'` 的简写，也支持 1D bool 条件。   "
"为了让教程稳定，我们先演示简写版（最不容易踩坑），后续再给 1D bool 的写法。"
msgstr ""
"highlight supports the shorthand `'max'/'min'`, and also supports a 1D bool "
"condition.   To keep the tutorial stable, we’ll first demonstrate the "
"shorthand version (least likely to trip you up), and later provide the 1D "
"bool form."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:419
msgid ""
"预期效果：图上会把 LONG 组合曲线的最大点（或某类图表定义的最大点）标出来。   在横向研究里，我们通常把这当成一个“提醒”：最大点附近往往是 "
"long 相对市场最顺风的一段，值得回头看当时筛选条件是否把我们带进了某种风格（例如强趋势、低波动等）。"
msgstr ""
"Expected result: the chart will mark the maximum point of the LONG portfolio"
" curve (or the maximum point as defined by a given chart).   In cross-"
"sectional research, we usually treat this as a “reminder”: around the "
"maximum point is often the period when long had the strongest tailwind "
"relative to the market, and it’s worth looking back to see whether the "
"screening criteria led us into a particular style (e.g., strong trend, low "
"volatility, etc.)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:422
msgid ""
"如果您想更贴近“long vs benchmark 的分化”，可以用一个更实用的做法：先算超额曲线（long 与 benchmark "
"的差值），再把超额曲线的最大点位置提出来，做成 1D bool 的 highlight 条件。（这里作为可选增强，不强制您在正文主线展开。）"
msgstr ""
"If you want to get closer to the \"differentiation of long vs benchmark\", "
"you can use a more practical approach: first calculate the excess curve (the"
" difference between long and benchmark), and then extract the maximum point "
"position of the excess curve to make a 1D bool highlight condition. (This is"
" an optional enhancement and does not force you to expand on the main line "
"of the text.)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:426
msgid "完整代码（单函数可跑版本）"
msgstr "Complete code (single function runnable version)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.7-historypanel-advanced-horizontal-multifactor.md:428
msgid "下面给出一段“单函数可跑”的完整版本，方便您复制进 Notebook 一键运行。它覆盖："
msgstr ""
"The complete version of a \"single function can be run\" is given below, "
"which is convenient for you to copy into Notebook and run with one click. It"
