msgid ""
"**迁移至正式回测**：[2.5 §9](2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md#9-从-historypanel-研究到-"
"strategy--operator迁移路径) 或 [教程 3](3-start-first-strategy.md)"
msgstr ""
